Code-level patch of the MQT-TZ RA: a message whose re-encryption failed, because the TA is out of
memory or panicked, is discarded (the 404 of the original artifact; Fig. 21, discardMsg) instead of
being forwarded with the content of the destination buffer.

--- a/main.c
+++ b/main.c
@@ -298,6 +298,8 @@
     // Results are stored in dest
     if (res == TEEC_SUCCESS)
         res = ta_res;
+    if (res == TEE_ERROR_OUT_OF_MEMORY || res == TEEC_ERROR_TARGET_DEAD)
+        *dest->data = DISCARDED;
     return res;
 }
 
